# macro_keyboard custom firmware module Kconfig.
#
# The custom status screen is selected via the upstream
# ZMK_DISPLAY_STATUS_SCREEN_CUSTOM choice.

# M5 — AS5600 encoder. SENSOR is already turned on by ZMK_KEYMAP_SENSORS (our
# zmk,keymap-sensors node selects it), so the driver lives under `if SENSOR`
# like ZMK's stock sensor drivers — selecting SENSOR from a symbol that also
# `depends on I2C` would create a Kconfig recursive dependency.
if SENSOR
rsource "drivers/sensor/as5600/Kconfig"
endif # SENSOR
